   155	## 10. Length and development — RETAIN THE SCENES
   156	
   157	**Measured length.** Current `wc -w` by chapter is 4,361 / 5,436 / 5,619 / 5,992 / 6,483 / 7,448 / 6,031 = **41,370**. That is about 115% of the ~36,000 packet budget and below the 42,000 map cap. OWNER #45 expressly orders M5–M9 to develop planned scenes more fully while forbidding padding and restored restatement (`OWNER-DECISIONS.md:134–135`).
