    68	
    69	"We're not running," said Lira. "We're walking."
    70	
    71	"I can see that. That's what I said." He turned toward the door. "Hay's what it says on the wall, and I don't charge it twice, whatever you've heard lower down. Mind the step. It's worn."
    72	
