   960	- **Plants:** the Book 9 plants placed — the leaf's "appended to… not the reading" and the millwright's race; Lira's "They *found* it… whatever's under it"; Vastin's "runs on the thing it accuses". The eleven seconds at Denvash as the function failing (for "Thanks for the eleven seconds", M9). No maker, will or purpose.
   961	
