   219	
   220	Every winning mechanism is taught before it is used: discharge sense (ford → Ring); flight (herd day → stampede); the line (perimeter trials → Ring, Stair); Anchor unbinding (B6 Ch13 → Stair); strike-what-stays (afternoon → Hall). Each win is writable as *X removed Y's ability to Z* (source checkpoint). The opponent learns: the pack at the ford stops testing silent bodies; the rim waits instead of entering.
   221	
