    38	- The stillhound's sense is **unknown** in this movement. Karis has the word, not the mechanism; the discharge finding belongs to M2. Nobody hears the words *quiet ground*. No healer, no Tide practitioner, no Oryn.
    39	- No Compact on the page, beyond the asset-restriction sentence and the void-style maps.
    40	- Teague and Cael exchange no words. The Thornwater carter is never named.
