    18	## What this movement is for
    19	
    20	A trap priced to fit, read before it is sprung; the sixth chair filled on her own terms of service; a floor built to disarm six people that disarms five; and the first registry object the crew has ever owned, with a word in it that is a direction. Turns and promises:
