editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:100:The source (≈118,400) is retold at roughly equal weight, plus ≈181,600 of new room. Every item serves the book promise (*make the reader feel the edge territories as the first place Cael has ever been fully free — and then make that freedom complicated*) or the arc (*no instrument out here reads me* → *nothing out here reads me, and the oldest thing out here stops every Path but mine*). Nothing below changes an end state or opens a reserved truth.
