+### N4 — two map records
+
+Book 7 inventories the printed sheet but does not preserve the separate entry markings. Karis's printed sheet and Lira's route book contain different, exact records (B6 ch60:135-167). Both must enter the state ledger.
+
+### N5 — Gault's last note is not a carried object
+
+`MOVEMENT-006.md:25` places Pike's delivered Fallow copy “beside Gault's last note.” Gault's note was entered at Bracken's counter with the withdrawal file; the party read it but did not carry the leaf east (B6 ch55:181-199). M6 may invoke Cael's memory of its last sentence, not stage the physical note.
+
+### N6 — cache knowledge and mechanism knowledge are distinct
+
+The Book 7 ledger states who knows the mechanism but omits the wider cache/falsification circle. At the handoff, six know the cache (the five travelers plus Vastin), while only the five travelers know the integration mechanism; Ephram and the academy do not (B6 ch52:61-105, 279-317; ch60:221-225; B6 ledger:1189-1194, 1348).
+
