+## New findings created by closed M8-M9
+
+### N1 — shelf chronology
+
+The Book 7 map calls the shelf the first camp; closed prose makes the wet cart-canvas night the first camp past the Line and the shelf the second camp and first fire (B6 ch59:351-361; ch60:3-57). OWNER #46 already directs Book 7, so this is an amendment, not an owner item.
