+## Release decision
+
+**Yes. Book 7 Movement 1 can be released for drafting after amendments 1-10 and 13-16 are applied, including the M1-authorized protected changes under OWNER #18 and #42.** The closed prose supplies every M1 entry fact: people, bodies, standings, fragments, anomaly, sealed/idle state, objects, letters, calendar and camp/fire order (B6 ch55:3-163; ch57:3-53; ch59:235-361; ch60:3-57, 117-225, 277-321).
+
