+Cael enters Book 7 with no open injury. His five Blade bars have blurred into a brown-violet left-forearm bruise, one week old and one week from gone; the **ten-count** road bill of headache/inability to eat has already cleared (B6 ch58:113-129, 281-303; ch60:191-201; B6 ledger:1332). Lira, Brom, Karis and Seln have no open injury at the shelf; Ephram's shoulder remains behind at Halcenvane (B6 ch54:109-137, 232-250; ch60:103-113; B6 ledger:1342).
