+- **B5 HOLDS.** Seln learned the mechanism in edition B6 ch37, recognized that Cael kept his file, and his “twice more” allowance remains two; M8 spends no telling (B6 ch37:99-103, 182; B6 ledger:1189-1190).
+- **B6 HOLDS.** The case has been carried twelve years, not six (B6 ch57:133-145).
