+Anchor remains idle and undeployed. It was declined throughout the public bout, offered no action at the paper Line, and did not define the Registry Line as a physical threshold (B6 ch54:272-278; ch59:291-305). Shadow remains sealed under the witness-who-can-carry-it-west condition; Cael explicitly leaves it sealed at the wet camp even after the watcher has turned back (B6 ch59:351-359). Deployment since the Line is therefore **none** (B6 ledger:1328, 1348).
