+### OI-2 — protected “Six years I've wanted a face”
+
+`BOOK_MAP.md:314` protects “Six years I've wanted a face,” and `MOVEMENT-007.md:25` repeats it as protected. Closed canon says Seln has carried the case twelve years; no distinct six-year trigger for wanting a face is established (B6 ch57:133-145).
