+The Book 7 ledger states who knows the mechanism but omits the wider cache/falsification circle. At the handoff, six know the cache (the five travelers plus Vastin), while only the five travelers know the integration mechanism; Ephram and the academy do not (B6 ch52:61-105, 279-317; ch60:221-225; B6 ledger:1189-1194, 1348).
